Description: Sentia branding and installer modules for Calamares
 Calamares settings and helper scripts for Sentia live media.
 The configuration starts from Debian trixie Calamares behavior while
 enforcing Signed-By repository handling, GPT+UEFI defaults, ext4+ESP,
 swapfile baseline, and cleanup of live-only install artifacts.
